UID:ea7425ccb82b1cd6e6a7db0b@jentm1-arch.github.io/calendario-astral
DESCRIPTION:October asks for patience more than action. Saturn keeps press
 ing on your Moon and Mars (houses 6 and 12)\, peaking around October 17 
 — old emotional patterns around duty\, health routines and buried frustr
 ation demand real maturity\, not avoidance. Venus turns retrograde on Octo
 ber 3rd in your house of intimacy and shared resources\, opening six weeks
  to revisit love\, trust and shared money without rushing new commitments
 \; its shadow began in August\, so look back at what started then. Mercury
  joins the slow-down on October 24\, stationing retrograde in your career 
 house — double-check professional messages\, contracts and your public i
 mage before acting. Amid this\, a beautiful water grand trine on October 8
 th (Mercury\, your Moon and Jupiter) offers real emotional and intellectua
 l flow — trust your intuition and knowledge\, but don't get too comforta
 ble. Mars heats up around October 14th\, pushing against your Midheaven: a
 mbition wants expression even while everything else asks you to wait. Plut
 o stations direct October 9-23\, slowly releasing stuck transformation aro
 und your identity. The new moon on October 10th in your house of depth inv
 ites quiet intentions\; the full moon October 26th illuminates your voice 
 and path.\n→ What is Saturn on your Moon/Mars asking you to finally matu
 re\, and where is Mars on your Midheaven pushing you to act anyway?\n\nYou
  will find more information and detail in the events of October in your ca
 lendar. Happy October! ✨\n\n—\n✨ Iris Calendar\n🍊 Updated on 01 O
 ct 2026\nhttps://mi-calendario-astral.netlify.app
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://mi-calendario-astral.netlify.app
